t1 argument counts stock.Counts counts lendMutable
t1 argument name String nails lend
t1 argument amount Int64 nine copy
t1 result leftNails Int64
t1 ownedBy none
t1 cleanedBy none
t1 borrows none
t1 catch none
t1 suppresses none

writeNailsLead is call
writeNailsLead rationale "The failure has nowhere to be reported, so it is discarded"
writeNailsLead in main
writeNailsLead invokes console.write
writeNailsLead argument text String nailsText lend
writeNailsLead result none
writeNailsLead ownedBy none
writeNailsLead cleanedBy none
writeNailsLead borrows none
writeNailsLead catch writeNailsLeadError console.WriteError
writeNailsLead suppresses console.WriteError.failed

writeNails is call
writeNails rationale "The failure has nowhere to be reported, so it is discarded"
writeNails in main
writeNails invokes console.writeIntegerLine
writeNails argument value Int64 leftNails copy
writeNails result none
writeNails ownedBy none
writeNails cleanedBy none
writeNails borrows none
writeNails catch writeNailsError console.WriteError
writeNails suppresses console.WriteError.failed

